study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"内在研究目的：确证性研究","quote_sha256":"9910bf06ee75c8853c143b11ec7df385f95306b1d5f76e729515dd9609db0a9c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_07_def_intent"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"开发区域：中国","quote_sha256":"cff843d358ea50e7e53ede8d1eba9b9d23baa740d2cd2134679e6483c3e50b76","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_08_def_region"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"目标研究人群：成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者","quote_sha256":"a1f2b59730f1d08cde8f6a85d4179e62887b3729f4175c98334b9dafda33e808","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_09_def_population"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验干预：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f3eff5ef57b4691ff025db695140e4ead682562786c0dec621edcd256ef28af3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_10_def_treat"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_14_def_periods"}],"evidence_span_ids":["esp_01_sel_design","esp_04_def_overall","esp_05_def_multicenter","esp_06_def_phase","esp_07_def_intent","esp_08_def_region","esp_09_def_population","esp_10_def_treat","esp_14_def_periods"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":8},"heading":"总体设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为在中国开展的多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组设计的III期确证性临床研究，目标研究人群为成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者。受试者在筛选合格后按1:1的比例随机分配至试验组或对照组，试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服、每日一次，对照组接受匹配安慰剂，双盲治疗期为16周。研究整体由最长4周的筛选期、16周双盲治疗期及4周安全性随访期组成。研究采用匹配安慰剂对照，以支持盲法维持并评价试验药相对于安慰剂的疗效与安全性。","rationale":"正文依据已确认的研究分期与确证性研究定位、开发区域、目标研究人群、总体设计类型、对照措施、给药方案以及研究时期等事实撰写。请医学作者核对研究中心数量、各设计要素的最终注册表述，以及本段疗效与安全性评价表述与安全性终点描述的一致性。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（总体设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b7de17e9668663cc","section_number":"4.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:15f9c2dd801c92185c0914d9","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922041306_d4eaee6e","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要研究目的：评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。","quote_sha256":"91f9668c833c01c737e00948c18613521366f596752872eef9fc69a09e681b8f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_16_def_objective"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要终点：第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"0726a50bb0c8f1c5ec79b9e21b343bfd08fddc0a595315a5c8e3769df01ce9a7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_17_def_primary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"估计目标策略：治疗策略人群为所有随机受试者；比较第16周PASI 75应答。停药或使用救援治疗按复合策略判定为无应答，其他缺失数据采用无应答填补；报告组间率差及95%置信区间。","quote_sha256":"44f71070d9cdb5b6b69ad6feeeb7fbfeef4aad105693eaa3500bedd537f18414","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_18_def_estimand"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"统计分析策略：全分析集按随机分组采用CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。","quote_sha256":"e9b17439a1b1c578052cd13dad05d71e672ffe680dded17beb6730e36d09e241","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_19_def_analysis"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要缺失处理采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。不开展期中分析。","quote_sha256":"fd2537e74e12deb090c5d78e3beecb40bd06d2b51a8a5a0ca24d8971e2adbe83","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_20_def_sensitivity"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"假设第16周PASI 75应答率试验组为60%、安慰剂组为30%，双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机，并考虑15%脱落，共计划入组132例（每组66例）。","quote_sha256":"a0aefac549689eb263351e3520483e7e8651a2ab218b3fbe25de8f066e94439c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_21_def_sample"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"样本量再估计是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"913a62236e4f4332a7188562f2625d53aa7f770cea155664564c5fb821a98efd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_22_def_noreestimate"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"期中分析是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"31ef70e7f5cd03d6c17b90802e7352c6e81b5fdc853989b74ea1499901f514a4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_23_def_nointerim"}],"evidence_span_ids":["esp_16_def_objective","esp_17_def_primary","esp_18_def_estimand","esp_19_def_analysis","esp_20_def_sensitivity","esp_21_def_sample","esp_22_def_noreestimate","esp_23_def_nointerim"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":8},"heading":"确证性设计与假设依据","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为确证性研究，采用优效性设计，主要目的是评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。主要终点为第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。本研究采用治疗策略的估计目标，分析人群为所有随机受试者；主要分析采用全分析集，按随机分组通过CMH方法比较主要终点，报告组间应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标；停药或使用救援治疗按复合策略判定为无应答，其他缺失数据采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析开展敏感性分析。样本量估计假设第16周PASI 75应答率试验组为60%、安慰剂组为30%，采用双侧α=0.05、把握度90%和1:1随机，并考虑15%脱落，共计划入组132例，每组66例。本研究不计划期中分析，也不计划样本量再估计。","rationale":"正文依据已确认的主要研究目的、主要终点、估计目标策略、分析方法、缺失数据处理与样本量假设等事实撰写。请医学作者与统计师核对样本量假设的文献依据、关键次要终点的多重性控制策略，以及敏感性分析方法的最终表述。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（确证性设计与假设依据）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、估计目标、期中分析、样本量、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_57a2ea891245f09c","section_number":"4.2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:15f9c2dd801c92185c0914d9","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922041306_d4eaee6e","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:15f9c2dd801c92185c0914d9","quote":"当前正文=随机化（随机分配）；双盲；安慰剂对照（匹配安慰剂）；平行组（parallel assignment）；多中心","quote_sha256":"20ace8cee8650e8264f10d4d3509afecb32d21820d4669c8231f7303fecb2814","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:15f9c2dd801c92185c0914d9","span_id":"esp_01_sel_design"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:15f9c2dd801c92185c0914d9","quote":"当前正文=采用随机化分配。随机分配","quote_sha256":"2f7f71fac428b63af7f62381d375fc8ec7f4a1698f2b63b71fb2e749134656c1","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:15f9c2dd801c92185c0914d9","span_id":"esp_02_sel_random"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"匹配安慰剂：每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。","quote_sha256":"ffc6cb29d83ff1fdff1723b4d70a2e3294e7e561c3310a66660f5c81fcf62439","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_12_def_placebo"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"对照：匹配安慰剂对照；试验组与安慰剂组按1:1随机分配，双盲治疗16周。","quote_sha256":"bcf69f1343deaa3b4cd6b8ab0fd4fbac84bf974c3118292b17999b1ba93aa172","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_13_def_random11"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。","quote_sha256":"63eabad83df6668ab707ddc556cc8da06b6cd29646215ef8e6dab242db644044","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_15_def_visit"}],"evidence_span_ids":["esp_01_sel_design","esp_02_sel_random","esp_12_def_placebo","esp_13_def_random11","esp_15_def_visit"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"heading":"随机化","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究采用随机化分配，受试者在筛选合格后于基线/第1天按1:1的比例随机分配至试验组或对照组，分别接受合成试验药A或匹配安慰剂，双盲治疗期为16周。随机分配与平行组、安慰剂对照及双盲设计相结合，构成研究控制选择偏倚与评价偏倚的基础，用于支持试验组与对照组在基线特征上的组间均衡，以及第16周主要疗效比较的可靠性。随机分配在筛选合格后实施，使合格受试者进入随机化程序时尚未接受研究治疗。","rationale":"正文依据已确认的随机分配比例、随机时点、设计类型与对照设置撰写。随机化方法、分层因素、区组大小、随机化系统及其实施职责与记录方式尚未在本项目已确认事实中体现，请医学作者会同统计与临床运营职能核对后在方案定稿中补充。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（随机化）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_a72266096758d298","section_number":"4.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:15f9c2dd801c92185c0914d9","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922041306_d4eaee6e","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:15f9c2dd801c92185c0914d9","quote":"当前正文=随机化（随机分配）；双盲；安慰剂对照（匹配安慰剂）；平行组（parallel assignment）；多中心","quote_sha256":"20ace8cee8650e8264f10d4d3509afecb32d21820d4669c8231f7303fecb2814","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:15f9c2dd801c92185c0914d9","span_id":"esp_01_sel_design"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:15f9c2dd801c92185c0914d9","quote":"当前正文=本研究采用双盲设计。","quote_sha256":"e58863fc32ce42781dcc11ee3528217151faad16ad3a16fe152a290f068a5eb7","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:15f9c2dd801c92185c0914d9","span_id":"esp_03_sel_blind"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"匹配安慰剂：每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。","quote_sha256":"ffc6cb29d83ff1fdff1723b4d70a2e3294e7e561c3310a66660f5c81fcf62439","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_12_def_placebo"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"对照：匹配安慰剂对照；试验组与安慰剂组按1:1随机分配，双盲治疗16周。","quote_sha256":"bcf69f1343deaa3b4cd6b8ab0fd4fbac84bf974c3118292b17999b1ba93aa172","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_13_def_random11"}],"evidence_span_ids":["esp_01_sel_design","esp_03_sel_blind","esp_12_def_placebo","esp_13_def_random11"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"heading":"盲法与揭盲","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究采用双盲设计。受试者按1:1比例随机分配至试验组或对照组，分别接受合成试验药A或匹配安慰剂，双盲治疗期为16周。双盲设计要求受试者、研究者及承担疗效与安全性评价的人员在揭盲前不知晓个体受试者的治疗分配；匹配安慰剂用于支持在不披露治疗分配的前提下完成给药、疗效评价与安全性观察。维持盲态可减少评价过程中的主观偏倚，是保障第16周主要疗效评价客观性的关键设计安排。","rationale":"正文依据已确认的双盲设计、匹配安慰剂对照、1:1随机分配和16周双盲治疗期撰写。盲态人员范围、揭盲触发条件与操作流程、紧急揭盲后的受试者处理及揭盲记录要求尚未在本项目已确认事实中体现，请医学作者会同统计、临床运营及相关职能核对后补充。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（盲法与揭盲）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_818d6b6aa87464a2","section_number":"4.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:15f9c2dd801c92185c0914d9","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:15f9c2dd801c92185c0914d9","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:15f9c2dd801c92185c0914d9","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"4292e9084e95c885fc8c38a4acf4829f948c11a8e2cc692a42d952d273526e47"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:随机和盲法|block:352|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"8daf6dc46d42155e29ca2768fe326bcf20208390c0e565062d237a9768f12e59"},{"locator":"section:随机和盲法|block:356|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"9dcf0050e6908f1bf1781d1b4e78bece680543f7bd3b6d430526c8fa0873ec33"},{"locator":"section:研究揭盲|block:464|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"1541424a072504b13dc999a7346751e32eebb848cc0771bb2ef3908b11c26ea0"},{"locator":"section:个例紧急揭盲|block:471|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"b1d5885b4afe4e5db3e8caef9a6db54129aefdb157084e23f8cc6b089099b16a"},{"locator":"section:6.3.3 揭盲|block:490|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"561c757e6967fae66f0f9d1043dba3e313bd0ee60a03f2c3c8da5efe892b0128"}]}